  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A professional may combine skill spheres and talents to perfect incredible acts of guile. Whenever the professional gains a skill talent, they must choose a skill sphere to spend it on. The first time a character spends a skill talent on a sphere, they gain that sphere’s base abilities instead of gaining a talent within the sphere.</p>\n<p>After a character possesses a base sphere, spending an additional skill talent on that sphere gains them one of that sphere’s talents. Professionals are considered Virtuoso operatives and choose Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma as their operative ability modifier. The Virtuoso skill talent progression is reprinted in the professional table for ease of reference. (Talents under Any can be any skill talent that the professional qualifies for, while talents listed under Utility must have the [utility] tag.)</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/professional#toc2\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
